  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675952",
      "title": "Programmatic \"Behind-the-Scenes\" Submission via useFetcher()",
      "lectureOrder": 76,
      "videoOrder": 70,
      "sourceHash": "13853ebcb9977acaf33be9fcfaf220a552696ad762143e92575c4f6330006e22",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.672,
          "end": 5.16,
          "en": "[Instructor} So now we're able to delete our expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.16,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "and we're doing this with one action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 9.18,
          "en": "that performs different things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "as explained in the previous lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 15.12,
          "en": "but there's one thing we could potentially improve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.12,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "This all works of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 21.8,
          "en": "but if I delete one of these items here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.05,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "then what happens technically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "behind the scenes is that this action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 29.94,
          "en": "of course, is executed and then thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.94,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "a redirect response is sent back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 35.4,
          "en": "Now since we're in a single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.4,
          "end": 38.73,
          "en": "thanks to this form element I'm using here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.73,
          "end": 40.77,
          "en": "we don't technically redirect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.77,
          "end": 42.99,
          "en": "We don't technically load a new page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.99,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "If you watch the spinner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.11,
          "en": "you see it never changes to a cross.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.11,
          "end": 48.33,
          "en": "But nonetheless, we got some logic here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.33,
          "end": 52.02,
          "en": "in our action that wants us to redirect to a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.02,
          "end": 53.493,
          "en": "on which we already are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.51,
          "end": 56.19,
          "en": "Now it might make more sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.19,
          "end": 58.56,
          "en": "to just return some json response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.56,
          "end": 60.96,
          "en": "some object with some information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.96,
          "end": 63.12,
          "en": "about the action that was performed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.12,
          "end": 65.37,
          "en": "Like for example, the deleted id.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.37,
          "end": 69.45,
          "en": "If we wanted to, we could return this kind of data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.45,
          "end": 71.743,
          "en": "So it would be nice if we don't have to return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.743,
          "end": 72.873,
          "en": "a redirect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 76.92,
          "en": "If we do that; however, the application breaks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.92,
          "end": 79.77,
          "en": "If I now click delete it then shows me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.77,
          "end": 82.2,
          "en": "that detail page all of a sudden",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 84.453,
          "en": "with that id as an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.77,
          "end": 88.35,
          "en": "The reason for that is that if I just return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "some raw data in the end, Remix assumes that as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 95.424,
          "en": "thereafter it sends a get request to the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.424,
          "end": 98.91,
          "en": "URL to which the delete request was sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 98.91,
          "end": 102.47999999999999,
          "en": "Now, the delete request URL was slash expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.47999999999999,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "slash the id of the expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 108.45,
          "en": "So therefore, as a next step, Remix sent a get request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.45,
          "end": 110.75,
          "en": "So that's of course also not what I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.66,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "Therefore, what we can do here is not use a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 117.6,
          "en": "but instead just a button with a click listener.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.6,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "And then here we could submit the form programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "Now that can be done with use submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "This gives us a submit function, which we can call here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129,
          "end": 132.24,
          "en": "and I covered this function early already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.24,
          "end": 135.27,
          "en": "And here the data which I wanna submit, can be null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.27,
          "end": 138.84,
          "en": "because the request doesn't have any data attached to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.84,
          "end": 142.59,
          "en": "The only data we need is the id, which is part of the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.59,
          "end": 145.3,
          "en": "So no data needs to be included in the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "but the request must be configured and the method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 153,
          "en": "should be set to delete and the action should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153,
          "end": 157.02,
          "en": "be set to this same URL we used down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.02,
          "end": 158.25,
          "en": "this same path,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 160.44299999999998,
          "en": "I mean this path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 164.853,
          "en": "So that would send this delete request programmatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.32,
          "end": 168.76,
          "en": "If we save that and I click delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "I still have the same behavior though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 174.96,
          "en": "and that's no coincidence or bug.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 178.89,
          "en": "Instead, submit is basically the programmatic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.89,
          "end": 181.5,
          "en": "equivalent to form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.5,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "So therefore, still thereafter Remix assumes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 186.51,
          "en": "that some navigation should happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.51,
          "end": 188.04,
          "en": "and it sends a get request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.04,
          "end": 191.34,
          "en": "to the path that was used for the delete request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.34,
          "end": 193.113,
          "en": "So that's also not helpful here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.04,
          "end": 197.64,
          "en": "Instead, if we wanna have an action on the back end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 197.64,
          "end": 199.59,
          "en": "that does not return our redirect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.59,
          "end": 203.94,
          "en": "but some raw data, we have to send the request differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.94,
          "end": 206.43,
          "en": "And that can be done with use fetcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.43,
          "end": 208.833,
          "en": "yet another hook provided by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.76,
          "end": 214.2,
          "en": "This gives us a fetcher object which contains various pieces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.2,
          "end": 218.313,
          "en": "of data and also a submit method as well as a load method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 219.27,
          "end": 222.3,
          "en": "Fetcher essentially is an object which you can use to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 225.51,
          "en": "build user interfaces where you wanna load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 225.51,
          "end": 226.98,
          "en": "or submit requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 226.98,
          "end": 231.21,
          "en": "So get or other kinds of requests behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 231.21,
          "end": 234.543,
          "en": "without triggering subsequent navigation actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.74,
          "end": 238.05,
          "en": "If you have a website or a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.05,
          "end": 241.62,
          "en": "on a website where you maybe have multiple buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.62,
          "end": 243.24,
          "en": "that should send requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 243.24,
          "end": 246.21,
          "en": "to some action behind the scenes when being clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.21,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "And you don't wanna navigate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 250.29,
          "en": "to a different page when such a button is clicked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.29,
          "end": 252.153,
          "en": "use fetcher is your friend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 253.65,
          "end": 257.88,
          "en": "So here in this example in delete expense item handler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.88,
          "end": 261.78,
          "en": "I can call fetcher submit like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 261.78,
          "end": 264.3,
          "en": "and then pass the same configuration I passed to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 264.3,
          "end": 267.6,
          "en": "submit to fetcher submit because it will still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 267.6,
          "end": 269.91,
          "en": "send an HTDP request behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.91,
          "end": 272.34000000000003,
          "en": "But, and that's the important difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 272.34000000000003,
          "end": 275.04,
          "en": "it will send a request that does not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 275.04,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "trigger a subsequent navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 277.47,
          "end": 281.46,
          "en": "but instead do nothing after being sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.46,
          "end": 285.93,
          "en": "So here I then use this same action path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 285.93,
          "end": 290.93,
          "en": "and with that if we save that, if I add a new expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 291.48,
          "end": 294.993,
          "en": "because I got no expenses left here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.36,
          "end": 298.51,
          "en": "if I click delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 299.4,
          "end": 300.57,
          "en": "it's deleted and we stay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 300.57,
          "end": 303.24,
          "en": "on this page without any extra navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 303.24,
          "end": 306.21,
          "en": "So here it's kind of optional because it did work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 306.21,
          "end": 310.38,
          "en": "before with that redirect to slash expenses as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 310.38,
          "end": 312.15,
          "en": "But if you are building a website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 312.15,
          "end": 315.06,
          "en": "a webpage on a website that needs to send such",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 315.06,
          "end": 316.68,
          "en": "behind the scenes requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.68,
          "end": 318.78,
          "en": "that should not trigger a navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.78,
          "end": 321.12,
          "en": "use fetcher, as mentioned, is your friend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.12,
          "end": 324.12,
          "en": "and that's why I wanted to show it here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 324.12,
          "end": 328.11,
          "en": "Now you can also get some useful information out of fetcher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 328.11,
          "end": 330.27,
          "en": "some useful information about the current state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.27,
          "end": 331.92,
          "en": "of the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 331.92,
          "end": 333.12,
          "en": "We could, for example, check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 333.12,
          "end": 336.65999999999997,
          "en": "if fetcher dot state is not equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 336.65999999999997,
          "end": 339.57,
          "en": "to idle and this might look familiar to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 339.57,
          "end": 341.31600000000003,
          "en": "That's the same kind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 341.31600000000003,
          "end": 343.95,
          "en": "of information we got from use navigation, that hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 343.95,
          "end": 346.56,
          "en": "which we're using in expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 346.56,
          "end": 348.84000000000003,
          "en": "So use navigation is simply being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 348.84000000000003,
          "end": 351.27,
          "en": "if you want to get some information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 351.27,
          "end": 355.62,
          "en": "about the currently ongoing request for the form element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 355.62,
          "end": 360.06,
          "en": "So for requests created with help of the form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 360.06,
          "end": 363.42,
          "en": "and fetcher dot state gives you the same information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 363.42,
          "end": 366.903,
          "en": "for requests created through fetcher submit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 368.01,
          "end": 369.24,
          "en": "So here we can find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 369.24,
          "end": 373.08,
          "en": "if a request created by fetcher is currently not being idle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 373.08,
          "end": 376.5,
          "en": "So if a request is on its way, and in that case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 376.5,
          "end": 378.51,
          "en": "we could return some different content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 378.51,
          "end": 383.01,
          "en": "for this list item and simply return an article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 383.01,
          "end": 387.51,
          "en": "with a class name of expense dash item locked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 387.51,
          "end": 389.58,
          "en": "These are two classes separated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 389.58,
          "end": 392.553,
          "en": "by a white space and they are important for styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 393.63,
          "end": 395.58299999999997,
          "en": "And then say, deleting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 397.02,
          "end": 400.11,
          "en": "The result of that would be that if I add yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 400.11,
          "end": 403.40999999999997,
          "en": "another expense like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 403.40999999999997,
